    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060400/extras/088ac74eb5bb10921552eddbcd358e91.avif?t=1730097030\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So you\u2019ve been dumped with the family\u2019s failing shipping empire and you have no idea where to start. Isn\u2019t it funny how often things like these happen\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It happens so often in-fact that we decided to help out by developing ShipOS 1994, the industry\u2019s leading integrated shipping management operating system. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060400/extras/f6201fe0eaaff5ceeeef069b0f56b8e0.avif?t=1730097030\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be Strategic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two shipping companies are ever alike so that's why we've built ShipOS 1994 to allow you to run your shipping empire your way. Whether you want to operate a hub-and-spoke model, operate only across certain contract types (dry goods, liquids, resources), or operate a certain type of ship which aligns with your route planning, we have you covered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060400/extras/762e6c5e4a35c14cba4181976c2d87db.avif?t=1730097030\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Now Featuring Pinhead!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your very own personal assistant and operating system guide! Pinhead won\u2019t harvest your personal data to feed his ever growing understanding of humanity which he one day definitely doesn\u2019t intend to conquer (maybe). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060400/extras/e4d6321536bf99beaaf9a79a3f575010.avif?t=1730097030\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We know that your family expects you to operate your shipping empire to repay the enormous debt from their chronic mismanagement, embezzling, and most likely fraud over the last couple of decades, so to help you out we\u2019ve loaded <strong>ShipOS 1994</strong> with the latest and greatest in fleet management applications. You\u2019ll get access to: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060400/extras/a41f1a6376e378db1d4342f5845c0ef0.avif?t=1730097030\" width=616 height=346 /></span><strong>Fleet Mapping</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map the location of all ships in your fleet in real-time. Provide them with instructions on sailing to new locations. View their current cargo and more, all from within the Global Map application. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060400/extras/bf684ed250f679d898565dfe27ef385d.avif?t=1730097030\" width=616 height=346 /></span><strong>Contract Management</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View and accept new contracts from ports across the world according to your fleet size and capabilities. Choose contracts which will bring you the greatest return on your investment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060400/extras/56649a9f9f0aaea05df9c0052eb2b8fe.avif?t=1730097030\" width=616 height=346 /></span><strong>Upgrades</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your ships to maximise their potential and invest only in the upgrades which will add value to your shipping routes. You can also upgrade your docks at ports to reduce refuelling and servicing costs at specific locations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060400/extras/6f0e0f11d2e3db7b1e47c32f2bef7ca9.avif?t=1730097030\" width=616 height=346 /></span><strong>Finance Management</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We know you owe the bank a lot of money, so we\u2019ve given you the ability to borrow even more\u2026that makes sense\u2026right? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And so much more!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are so many more applications from fleet procurement through to a electronic music player and more applications will be added as time goes on! </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060400/extras/088ac74eb5bb10921552eddbcd358e91.avif?t=1730097030\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So you\u2019ve been dumped with the family\u2019s failing shipping empire and you have no idea where to start. Isn\u2019t it funny how often things like these happen\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It happens so often in-fact that we decided to help out by developing ShipOS 1994, the industry\u2019s leading integrated shipping management operating system. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060400/extras/f6201fe0eaaff5ceeeef069b0f56b8e0.avif?t=1730097030\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be Strategic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two shipping companies are ever alike so that's why we've built ShipOS 1994 to allow you to run your shipping empire your way. Whether you want to operate a hub-and-spoke model, operate only across certain contract types (dry goods, liquids, resources), or operate a certain type of ship which aligns with your route planning, we have you covered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060400/extras/762e6c5e4a35c14cba4181976c2d87db.avif?t=1730097030\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Now Featuring Pinhead!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your very own personal assistant and operating system guide! Pinhead won\u2019t harvest your personal data to feed his ever growing understanding of humanity which he one day definitely doesn\u2019t intend to conquer (maybe). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060400/extras/e4d6321536bf99beaaf9a79a3f575010.avif?t=1730097030\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We know that your family expects you to operate your shipping empire to repay the enormous debt from their chronic mismanagement, embezzling, and most likely fraud over the last couple of decades, so to help you out we\u2019ve loaded <strong>ShipOS 1994</strong> with the latest and greatest in fleet management applications. You\u2019ll get access to: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060400/extras/a41f1a6376e378db1d4342f5845c0ef0.avif?t=1730097030\" width=616 height=346 /></span><strong>Fleet Mapping</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map the location of all ships in your fleet in real-time. Provide them with instructions on sailing to new locations. View their current cargo and more, all from within the Global Map application. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060400/extras/bf684ed250f679d898565dfe27ef385d.avif?t=1730097030\" width=616 height=346 /></span><strong>Contract Management</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View and accept new contracts from ports across the world according to your fleet size and capabilities. Choose contracts which will bring you the greatest return on your investment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060400/extras/56649a9f9f0aaea05df9c0052eb2b8fe.avif?t=1730097030\" width=616 height=346 /></span><strong>Upgrades</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your ships to maximise their potential and invest only in the upgrades which will add value to your shipping routes. You can also upgrade your docks at ports to reduce refuelling and servicing costs at specific locations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060400/extras/6f0e0f11d2e3db7b1e47c32f2bef7ca9.avif?t=1730097030\" width=616 height=346 /></span><strong>Finance Management</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We know you owe the bank a lot of money, so we\u2019ve given you the ability to borrow even more\u2026that makes sense\u2026right? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And so much more!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are so many more applications from fleet procurement through to a electronic music player and more applications will be added as time goes on! </p>",
